eitaas-linux (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Ship one binary package containing the bundled Remmina/FreeRDP client, the
    eitaas-remmina launcher, the eitaas command-line helper, and the EITaaS
    Connect GTK 4 helper.
  * Break, replace, and provide the former eitaas-remmina and eitaas-linux-gui
    packages so existing installations upgrade cleanly.

 -- EITaaS-Linux contributors <sjtrotter@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 30 Aug 2026 16:00:00 +0000

